  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth-driven Culinary Diplomacy Denmark-Somaliland - Cooking Across Borders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building global and local collaboration: through the fusion of Somali and Danish food culture promoting sustainable food as a leeway to realising the SDGs globally.  

Empowerment of youth: Youth is given a craft and a platform to promote their calls to action for a sustainable society i.e. blue-green jobs, climate resilience, peace and security and gender equality in Somaliland and Denmark.

Promoting Danish and Somali partnerships through inclusive and innovative festival formats that localize the SDGs, create collaborations and spaces for youth to come together as well as showcase examples of Danish development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
